1
00:00:20,459 --> 00:00:21,630
Are the rumors true?

2
00:00:22,689 --> 00:00:23,700
What rumors?

3
00:00:23,899 --> 00:00:26,630
That you, An Soo Ho, and Yeon Si Eun
caught some bullies.

4
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:27,770
The one who runs the betting site.

5
00:00:30,399 --> 00:00:31,799
Yes.

6
00:00:32,369 --> 00:00:33,840
- Gosh.
- That's insane.

7
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:36,269
My friend lost several thousand dollars
on that site.

8
00:00:36,509 --> 00:00:38,479
What happened, exactly? Tell us, Bum Seok.

9
00:00:38,479 --> 00:00:41,409
- Bum Seok, is that how you are?
- I'm dying to know. Spill the beans.

10
00:00:52,790 --> 00:00:54,089
Did you get home safely that day?

11
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:57,030
Yes, thank you.

12
00:00:58,259 --> 00:00:59,259
You?

13
00:00:59,659 --> 00:01:00,970
I got home safely too.

14
00:01:06,339 --> 00:01:07,610
Idiots.

15
00:01:20,019 --> 00:01:21,019
What's up?

16
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:38,900
Can you eat all that?

17
00:01:39,239 --> 00:01:41,739
Yes, and I'll go to the snack bar too.
Right, Oh Bum?

18
00:01:41,739 --> 00:01:43,539
Sure. It's on me. Let's go together.

19
00:01:43,539 --> 00:01:44,810
No, don't do that.

20
00:01:44,810 --> 00:01:46,579
It's on me today.

21
00:01:46,810 --> 00:01:48,610
Knock yourselves out, guys.

22
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:51,750
Are you guys free this weekend?

23
00:01:52,250 --> 00:01:54,120
I've scoped out a good restaurant.
Let's go together.

24
00:01:54,489 --> 00:01:55,890
I love good restaurants.

25
00:01:55,890 --> 00:01:57,789
Let's go. Let's do it.

26
00:02:00,189 --> 00:02:02,159
How can you talk about food
when you're already eating?

27
00:02:05,730 --> 00:02:09,099
Then don't you talk about life
while living?

28
00:02:15,069 --> 00:02:16,939
Hey, what's going on
with Young Yi's part-time job?

29
00:02:17,509 --> 00:02:18,780
She has an interview this weekend.

30
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:21,849
They needed to hire someone, so it's good.

31
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:25,220
- Who's Young Yi?
- You know,

32
00:02:25,220 --> 00:02:28,090
the one who struck the bully's head.

33
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:32,919
Oh, her. You knew her already?

34
00:02:33,259 --> 00:02:34,330
No.

35
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:39,800
She's staying with Su Ho temporarily.

36
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,169
Shall we ask her to join us this weekend?

37
00:02:44,970 --> 00:02:47,139
Sure, that's fine by me.

38
00:03:22,710 --> 00:03:26,009
(An Soo Ho)

39
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:31,780
(An Soo Ho is following.)

40
00:03:35,050 --> 00:03:37,520
(An Soo Ho is following.)

41
00:03:39,460 --> 00:03:41,560
(Young Yi)

42
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:51,840
(Posts)

43
00:03:58,180 --> 00:03:59,740
(Dinner with Su Ho's grandma...)

44
00:04:04,180 --> 00:04:07,120
(Delicious burger)

45
00:04:32,739 --> 00:04:33,809
How's Dad?

46
00:04:36,309 --> 00:04:39,380
He's busy these days
since it's high season.

47
00:04:43,190 --> 00:04:44,520
Have you decided what you'll do next?

48
00:04:48,429 --> 00:04:49,489
Not yet.

49
00:04:50,059 --> 00:04:51,830
Take your time and think carefully.

50
00:04:52,999 --> 00:04:56,830
I'm not worried about you.
You're responsible and good at everything.

51
00:05:00,609 --> 00:05:01,970
There are many things I'm not good at.

52
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:05,080
Huh?

53
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,080
It's nothing.

54
00:05:17,989 --> 00:05:19,960
You're done, right?

55
00:05:20,359 --> 00:05:22,890
Let's have coffee on the way.
I have a meeting.

56
00:05:27,499 --> 00:05:29,999
Hello? I'm on my way.

57
00:05:31,140 --> 00:05:32,799
I really can't decide
what to do on your birthday.

58
00:05:33,499 --> 00:05:34,570
What should we do?

59
00:05:35,070 --> 00:05:38,609
What's the big deal?
Just have a nice meal.

60
00:05:39,710 --> 00:05:41,549
How can we do nothing for your birthday?

61
00:05:41,549 --> 00:05:42,849
We have to do something fun.

62
00:05:42,909 --> 00:05:45,450
I'm telling you, it's not necessary.

63
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:47,320
What's this? Is it your birthday, Su Ho?

64
00:05:48,090 --> 00:05:49,419
Yes, on Saturday the week after next.

65
00:05:50,349 --> 00:05:51,559
Shall we rent a party room?

66
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:55,030
Look, woman, don't you have to save money?

67
00:05:55,289 --> 00:05:56,890
Didn't you say you're studying for exams?

68
00:06:03,070 --> 00:06:05,039
The menu's huge. What should I drink?

69
00:06:07,210 --> 00:06:08,239
What would you like?

70
00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:10,909
An Iced Americano for me.

71
00:06:10,979 --> 00:06:13,280
I'll have Viennese Iced Coffee.

72
00:06:16,109 --> 00:06:17,320
Let's go and get a table.

73
00:06:18,780 --> 00:06:20,049
Let's sit here.

74
00:06:23,020 --> 00:06:24,220
Sit here.

75
00:06:25,820 --> 00:06:27,090
Would you like to order, sir?

76
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:47,950
Hey, Si Eun!

77
00:06:50,650 --> 00:06:52,150
Come quickly. Sit here.

78
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:54,690
Why are you all spruced up today?

79
00:06:55,820 --> 00:06:58,159
Did you think I'd be impressed?
You're clever.

80
00:06:58,159 --> 00:06:59,419
Where have you been?

81
00:07:02,229 --> 00:07:03,489
I had something on.

82
00:07:04,059 --> 00:07:05,729
You had something on? Like what?

83
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:08,999
He's being so secretive.

84
00:07:08,999 --> 00:07:10,669
I know exactly where Si Eun's been.

85
00:07:12,700 --> 00:07:14,210
Stop tracking my location.

86
00:07:14,210 --> 00:07:16,340
No, I'll track you all the way home.

87
00:07:16,609 --> 00:07:17,979
Yes, check his movements.

88
00:07:18,309 --> 00:07:19,409
I use a tracking app.

89
00:07:21,679 --> 00:07:23,179
Hey, Oh Bum, what's going on?

90
00:07:34,590 --> 00:07:37,059
(Park Ji Hoon)

91
00:07:37,229 --> 00:07:39,830
(Choi Hyun Wook)

92
00:07:39,929 --> 00:07:42,169
(Hong Kyung)

93
00:07:42,570 --> 00:07:43,830
(Lee Yeon)

94
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:46,270
(Shin Seung Ho)

95
00:07:46,539 --> 00:07:51,640
(Weak Hero Class 1)

96
00:08:35,619 --> 00:08:38,160
(Screenplay and production by Yu Su Min)

97
00:08:38,420 --> 00:08:41,889
(Originated from "Weak Hero"
by Seo Pae Seu and Kim Jin Seok)

98
00:08:44,759 --> 00:08:49,529
It's late, why didn't you call sooner?

99
00:08:49,529 --> 00:08:54,269
Let's just meet later during the day

100
00:08:54,269 --> 00:08:58,940
I knew I'd regret it,
but I contacted my ex-girlfriend

101
00:08:58,940 --> 00:09:02,279
What are you doing now? Are you sleeping?

102
00:09:02,279 --> 00:09:04,119
Are you out?

103
00:09:04,119 --> 00:09:08,820
I'm sending random text messages
out of the blue

104
00:09:08,820 --> 00:09:13,619
I don't have an ulterior motive

105
00:09:13,619 --> 00:09:16,389
It's just that I'm bored

106
00:09:16,389 --> 00:09:18,200
- Do you want a drink?
- What?

107
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,229
Do you want a drink?

108
00:09:19,499 --> 00:09:20,930
Yes. Should I go with you?

109
00:09:20,930 --> 00:09:22,300
No, I'll go alone.

110
00:09:23,570 --> 00:09:26,139
I suddenly feel empty, I try flirting

111
00:09:26,139 --> 00:09:29,040
With everyone, I have no shame tonight

112
00:09:32,940 --> 00:09:35,749
(1 dollar)

113
00:09:42,489 --> 00:09:43,749
(1 dollar)

114
00:09:52,029 --> 00:09:53,200
Darn it.

115
00:09:53,629 --> 00:09:55,470
Hey, it's Oh Bum Seok.

116
00:09:55,930 --> 00:09:57,269
- It's Oh Bum Seok?
- Hey, you!

117
00:09:57,470 --> 00:09:59,239
What's Bum Seok doing here?

118
00:09:59,239 --> 00:10:01,470
- You're crazy.
- Stop lying.

119
00:10:01,470 --> 00:10:03,369
- I really saw him.
- No, you didn't.

120
00:10:03,369 --> 00:10:06,310
- Are you sure?
- Where are you, little Bum Seok?

121
00:10:06,310 --> 00:10:07,649
Does Bum Seok actually sing?

122
00:10:07,649 --> 00:10:09,710
- Bum Seok!
- Try calling him.

123
00:10:33,700 --> 00:10:35,109
Yes, we're at the karaoke.

124
00:10:36,410 --> 00:10:37,639
What's our room number?

125
00:10:38,279 --> 00:10:39,310
I don't know.

126
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,979
A friend of yours keeps calling.

127
00:10:46,279 --> 00:10:48,019
What are you doing? Are you insane?

128
00:10:48,450 --> 00:10:50,649
Why did you answer my phone? Darn it.

129
00:10:52,359 --> 00:10:53,820
What's going on with you?

130
00:10:54,830 --> 00:10:56,229
You look like you're about to hit me.

131
00:10:57,660 --> 00:10:58,960
Shut it.

132
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:02,029
Hey, that's enough.
What's up with you all of a sudden?

133
00:11:04,899 --> 00:11:05,970
Bum Seok.

134
00:11:08,470 --> 00:11:09,739
I told you to cut it out.

135
00:11:16,410 --> 00:11:18,379
You idiot.

136
00:11:19,519 --> 00:11:20,519
Get out of my way.

137
00:11:21,149 --> 00:11:22,619
Hey!

138
00:11:24,660 --> 00:11:25,820
I'll be back.

139
00:11:29,029 --> 00:11:30,190
Hey, where are you going?

140
00:11:34,769 --> 00:11:35,869
Are you okay?

141
00:11:40,570 --> 00:11:42,970
Yes, I'm okay.

142
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:47,649
- Hey, Bum Seok.
- See? I told you I saw him.

143
00:11:47,649 --> 00:11:49,210
Hey, little Bum Seok!

144
00:11:50,749 --> 00:11:52,050
How have you been, Bum Seok?

145
00:11:53,450 --> 00:11:54,849
It's been a really long time.

146
00:11:55,749 --> 00:11:56,950
We missed you.

147
00:12:00,489 --> 00:12:01,489
What's going on?

148
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:03,790
We're Bum Seok's friends.

149
00:12:06,999 --> 00:12:08,229
We're in the middle of a conversation.

150
00:12:09,599 --> 00:12:11,800
We want to talk to him too
since it's been so long.

151
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:15,369
Why don't you come back later?

152
00:12:21,649 --> 00:12:22,749
Right. Sorry.

153
00:12:23,779 --> 00:12:25,680
See you around. We'll call you.

154
00:12:26,820 --> 00:12:28,489
Please pick up when we call.

155
00:12:30,349 --> 00:12:32,460
- Let's go.
- See you soon.

156
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:34,660
He hasn't changed.

157
00:12:38,729 --> 00:12:39,759
What was that?

158
00:12:41,670 --> 00:12:43,529
- What?
- Those guys.

159
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:46,940
Oh...

160
00:12:48,639 --> 00:12:49,840
It's nothing.

161
00:12:58,019 --> 00:12:59,550
It's hilarious.

162
00:13:02,090 --> 00:13:03,889
You idiot.

163
00:13:03,889 --> 00:13:05,389
You sound like an idiot.

164
00:13:06,060 --> 00:13:08,529
- He's always like this.
- Yes, all the time.

165
00:13:09,489 --> 00:13:10,489
Hey.

166
00:13:13,599 --> 00:13:15,200
Can you sing one more time?

167
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,229
Hey!

168
00:13:21,470 --> 00:13:22,540
Be quiet.

169
00:13:27,310 --> 00:13:28,710
I'm telling you to shut it.

170
00:13:37,050 --> 00:13:38,119
What's wrong with you?

171
00:13:39,290 --> 00:13:40,389
I haven't said anything.

172
00:13:41,590 --> 00:13:43,259
You're laughing.

173
00:13:43,489 --> 00:13:45,229
Do you have a death wish?

174
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:49,700
Hey, Bum Seok. What's up with you?

175
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:55,509
He's getting cocky because he's friends
with An Soo Ho and Yeon Si Eun.

176
00:13:55,509 --> 00:13:56,509
What was that?

177
00:13:57,940 --> 00:13:59,239
Hey, come on.

178
00:13:59,410 --> 00:14:01,710
What's going on?

179
00:14:01,710 --> 00:14:03,349
I have no idea.
He's acting crazy for no reason.

180
00:14:03,349 --> 00:14:06,920
- You scumbag, do you want to die?
- Hey, that's enough.

181
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:09,019
- What are you looking at, you scumbag?
- Hey.

182
00:14:09,019 --> 00:14:10,989
Why are you acting so tough?
You're so cute.

183
00:14:10,989 --> 00:14:12,690
- Let's go to the snack bar, Si Eun.
- Yes.

184
00:14:15,359 --> 00:14:17,090
Stop putting your arm around me.

185
00:14:19,399 --> 00:14:20,399
What?

186
00:14:30,410 --> 00:14:31,739
What's wrong with him?

187
00:14:48,029 --> 00:14:49,629
Bum Seok.

188
00:14:53,660 --> 00:14:58,499
(Scumbag 3)

189
00:15:00,970 --> 00:15:04,639
(Scumbag 4)

190
00:15:18,619 --> 00:15:20,320
(Switch off)

191
00:15:54,019 --> 00:15:57,160
Isn't it exhilarating
to work up a sweat in the morning?

192
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,570
Did you manage to get through to Oh Bum?

193
00:16:06,269 --> 00:16:07,369
No.

194
00:16:07,369 --> 00:16:10,840
Maybe something's wrong.
He's not answering his phone.

195
00:16:11,680 --> 00:16:14,849
Shall we go to his place later?

196
00:16:15,710 --> 00:16:17,349
Yes, let's do that.

197
00:16:19,019 --> 00:16:21,149
Get up.

198
00:16:22,090 --> 00:16:24,660
You told me we were just running today.
What more do you want me to do?

199
00:16:24,660 --> 00:16:26,690
I told you we're training today.

200
00:16:27,019 --> 00:16:28,190
Let's just do the basics.

201
00:16:31,700 --> 00:16:33,700
Feet apart to shoulder width.

202
00:16:34,399 --> 00:16:36,300
Turn the feet out diagonally.

203
00:16:37,099 --> 00:16:39,869
I told you I don't need it.
Just go and sleep. You must be tired.

204
00:16:40,599 --> 00:16:42,440
Don't worry, I'm not tired. Come on.

205
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:49,749
The chin must always be tucked.

206
00:16:50,450 --> 00:16:51,720
Raise your fists like this.

207
00:16:52,580 --> 00:16:55,019
Your arms must always protect your chin.

208
00:16:55,019 --> 00:16:57,190
Remember that. Chin.

209
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:01,889
Next. There's someone in front of you.

210
00:17:01,889 --> 00:17:04,759
He's telling you he'll beat you to death.

211
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:09,170
In that situation, don't look at his eyes.
Look at his shoulders.

212
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:12,239
Watch.

213
00:17:14,839 --> 00:17:16,309
Watch the shoulders.

214
00:17:16,870 --> 00:17:19,279
When a shoulder
is about to come toward you,

215
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:21,610
bend your body 90 degrees.

216
00:17:22,710 --> 00:17:25,079
In this position,
grab his knees and push him to the ground.

217
00:17:25,079 --> 00:17:27,019
One, two, three, like this.

218
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,190
This is called "take down."

219
00:17:31,620 --> 00:17:34,059
After that,

220
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:38,100
don't beat him but run for it.

221
00:17:39,029 --> 00:17:40,259
Don't even look back.

222
00:17:42,870 --> 00:17:44,839
Make a run for it
while your opponent is on the ground.

223
00:17:46,100 --> 00:17:47,600
Don't try to fight. You'll get hurt.

224
00:17:51,539 --> 00:17:52,539
Got it?

225
00:18:01,890 --> 00:18:04,489
It's here, right?
His house is really fancy!

226
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:11,729
What are you doing here?

227
00:18:15,029 --> 00:18:16,600
Why is your phone
switched off all the time?

228
00:18:18,799 --> 00:18:20,839
I didn't know. Come in.

229
00:18:22,269 --> 00:18:25,839
Why didn't you come to school?

230
00:18:27,079 --> 00:18:28,350
Your house is crazy fancy!

231
00:18:29,150 --> 00:18:30,680
I didn't feel too well.

232
00:18:31,180 --> 00:18:33,120
- Wear those.
- Gosh.

233
00:18:33,120 --> 00:18:35,819
Your house must be the reason you're thin.

234
00:18:35,819 --> 00:18:37,220
You'd lose weight
walking around this house.

235
00:18:38,420 --> 00:18:39,620
Your house is so big.

236
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:42,930
Is that a money tree?

237
00:18:42,930 --> 00:18:46,559
To accumulate wealth?

238
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:48,569
Gosh, this is insane.

239
00:18:49,229 --> 00:18:51,900
This room is so large
that it's as big as my entire house.

240
00:18:52,039 --> 00:18:53,339
Are you feeling really bad?

241
00:18:54,970 --> 00:18:58,079
No, just a bit.

242
00:18:58,079 --> 00:19:00,809
Gosh, your mom is really beautiful.

243
00:19:00,809 --> 00:19:02,710
Your family looks so happy in this photo.

244
00:19:03,410 --> 00:19:05,279
And all the family members look alike.

245
00:19:06,079 --> 00:19:07,249
They're not my family.

246
00:19:11,190 --> 00:19:14,120
My father publicly adopted me
when he entered into politics.

247
00:19:14,630 --> 00:19:16,029
To improve his public image.

248
00:19:22,670 --> 00:19:23,900
Would you like something to drink?

249
00:19:33,309 --> 00:19:34,610
Is something up?

250
00:19:36,509 --> 00:19:37,809
No.

251
00:19:37,809 --> 00:19:40,279
What is it?

252
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:42,289
Tell me.

253
00:19:45,019 --> 00:19:46,059
Is it...

254
00:19:47,620 --> 00:19:50,229
because of those guys
at the karaoke last time...

255
00:19:52,329 --> 00:19:53,499
by any chance?

256
00:19:53,559 --> 00:19:55,769
Karaoke? What karaoke?

257
00:20:07,309 --> 00:20:08,979
Get him.

258
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:12,220
Get out of the way, you guys.

259
00:20:14,049 --> 00:20:15,120
Stand at ease.

260
00:20:16,089 --> 00:20:19,420
- I told you to stand at ease, you mutt.
- Do as you're told!

261
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:22,630
You're petrified, aren't you?

262
00:20:22,630 --> 00:20:25,600
- Here goes.
- Show him.

263
00:20:26,029 --> 00:20:27,329
Nice shot!

264
00:20:29,499 --> 00:20:31,299
- Are you crying?
- You lowlife.

265
00:20:31,299 --> 00:20:33,100
Don't pretend you're in pain.

266
00:20:33,100 --> 00:20:36,140
Bum Seok, why don't you
go tattle to your dad again?

267
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:39,640
Let's go. It's no fun beating him up.

268
00:20:39,779 --> 00:20:41,950
I'm starving. Let's go eat.

269
00:20:46,380 --> 00:20:48,420
I was bullied...

270
00:20:49,789 --> 00:20:51,150
at my previous school.

271
00:20:52,489 --> 00:20:53,989
I had to go to the hospital many times...

272
00:20:55,489 --> 00:20:56,960
because of them.

273
00:20:57,960 --> 00:20:59,759
That's also why I moved school.

274
00:21:01,870 --> 00:21:05,900
After running into them at the karaoke,
they keep calling me.

275
00:21:06,739 --> 00:21:07,839
Asking me to come out to meet them.

276
00:21:10,269 --> 00:21:11,440
That's awful.

277
00:21:12,509 --> 00:21:15,479
Why did those scumbags do that to you?

278
00:21:16,710 --> 00:21:18,049
What did you do wrong?

279
00:21:18,549 --> 00:21:21,380
That's just what they do.
Bullying one kid...

280
00:21:21,380 --> 00:21:24,989
to get closer to one another
and to raise their own status.

281
00:21:25,690 --> 00:21:28,529
I didn't do anything wrong.
I just went about my life.

282
00:21:30,529 --> 00:21:31,829
It's okay, Bum Seok.

283
00:21:35,299 --> 00:21:36,670
You didn't do anything wrong.

284
00:21:44,239 --> 00:21:45,610
Call those scumbags.

285
00:21:49,850 --> 00:21:50,850
What?

286
00:21:53,319 --> 00:21:54,720
I'll get them to apologize.

287
00:21:56,350 --> 00:21:57,390
Call them.

288
00:21:58,589 --> 00:22:00,289
Will be there

289
00:22:00,289 --> 00:22:04,360
Inexorably day by day

290
00:22:04,360 --> 00:22:08,499
You're awful. You call that singing?

291
00:22:10,670 --> 00:22:11,940
(Mutt Bum Seok)

292
00:22:12,069 --> 00:22:13,600
Hey, guys!

293
00:22:13,600 --> 00:22:15,539
- Why did you turn off the music?
- Why did you do that?

294
00:22:16,009 --> 00:22:18,239
Darn. Bum Seok is calling.

295
00:22:18,380 --> 00:22:19,910
- Serious?
- I think so.

296
00:22:19,910 --> 00:22:21,549
- Be quiet, everyone.
- It's little Bum Seok?

297
00:22:24,150 --> 00:22:26,249
Hi, Bum Seok. Where are you?

298
00:22:32,589 --> 00:22:35,360
These guys are always at the karaoke.
Don't they ever study?

299
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:37,529
You can talk.

300
00:22:43,729 --> 00:22:45,799
Don't be scared. You're with us.

301
00:23:18,370 --> 00:23:19,569
Bum Seok!

302
00:23:20,370 --> 00:23:22,170
- Oh Bum!
- Bum Seok!

303
00:23:22,170 --> 00:23:23,710
Did you bring friends, Bum Seok?

304
00:23:23,710 --> 00:23:26,640
This place stinks of cigarette smoke.

305
00:23:29,809 --> 00:23:30,880
What's this?

306
00:23:34,249 --> 00:23:35,289
Apologize.

307
00:23:39,789 --> 00:23:41,120
I told you to apologize.

308
00:23:45,400 --> 00:23:46,460
Did you see that?

309
00:23:49,329 --> 00:23:50,799
What are you talking about?

310
00:23:50,799 --> 00:23:52,569
Apologize for what you did to me.

311
00:23:53,170 --> 00:23:54,839
Bum Seok,

312
00:23:56,069 --> 00:23:59,809
people apologize
when they've done something wrong.

313
00:24:01,279 --> 00:24:04,279
But we're friends, aren't we, Bum Seok?

314
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:07,779
We had fun together,

315
00:24:09,489 --> 00:24:10,720
so what's got into you?

316
00:24:12,460 --> 00:24:13,460
What?

317
00:24:15,559 --> 00:24:16,589
You.

318
00:24:17,789 --> 00:24:19,259
Apologize properly.

319
00:24:19,259 --> 00:24:21,630
- What?
- How many times do we have to say it?

320
00:24:22,299 --> 00:24:24,670
Apologize if you don't want to die.

321
00:24:24,769 --> 00:24:25,900
Stop messing around.

322
00:24:29,309 --> 00:24:30,640
Bum Seok,

323
00:24:34,140 --> 00:24:36,710
what are you playing at, you scumbag?

324
00:24:40,620 --> 00:24:42,350
Should we be friends again like before?

325
00:24:43,749 --> 00:24:44,850
And see one another every day?

326
00:24:50,229 --> 00:24:51,660
You're stalling, aren't you?

327
00:24:53,299 --> 00:24:54,960
- Wait, wait.
- Come on, then.

328
00:24:54,960 --> 00:24:56,829
- Okay, I'll do it.
- Come over here.

329
00:24:56,829 --> 00:24:59,200
Okay, I said I'll do it!

330
00:25:07,440 --> 00:25:09,210
Come on, apologize.

331
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,049
I'm sorry.

332
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:22,559
I'm really sorry.

333
00:25:25,130 --> 00:25:26,259
If you're sorry,

334
00:25:28,370 --> 00:25:29,569
you're okay if I hit you once, right?

335
00:25:31,069 --> 00:25:32,069
What?

336
00:25:33,100 --> 00:25:36,009
You're not really sorry. So I'll hit you.

337
00:25:37,809 --> 00:25:40,979
Good idea.
Take a hit and be done with it like a man.

338
00:25:44,809 --> 00:25:48,920
I said I'm terribly sorry, Bum Seok.

339
00:25:55,329 --> 00:25:56,460
You've lost your mind.

340
00:26:00,759 --> 00:26:01,829
Are you all right?

341
00:26:15,779 --> 00:26:17,009
Hey!

342
00:26:20,079 --> 00:26:22,789
Hey, stop that.

343
00:26:23,850 --> 00:26:25,160
Don't go too far.

344
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:30,089
Hey!

345
00:26:31,029 --> 00:26:33,700
- Don't go too far.
- Let go of me, you scumbag!

346
00:26:33,700 --> 00:26:36,229
- Stop it.
- You scumbag!

347
00:26:38,640 --> 00:26:39,940
- Come here.
- You scumbag!

348
00:26:52,519 --> 00:26:53,579
You guys,

349
00:26:54,819 --> 00:26:56,549
don't contact Bum Seok again.

350
00:27:01,289 --> 00:27:02,489
Get your hands off me.

351
00:27:03,589 --> 00:27:04,930
You're suffocating me.

352
00:27:05,930 --> 00:27:07,799
All right. I'm sorry.

353
00:27:08,229 --> 00:27:11,839
I told you not to put
your arms around my shoulders.

354
00:27:11,839 --> 00:27:14,839
- Why do you keep dragging me around?
- What?

355
00:27:14,839 --> 00:27:17,470
Why do you keep ordering me around?

356
00:27:17,470 --> 00:27:20,440
Do I have to stop because you tell me to?

357
00:27:20,839 --> 00:27:23,110
Do you know what those guys did to me?

358
00:27:23,549 --> 00:27:24,809
Do you have any idea?

359
00:27:25,579 --> 00:27:27,350
When did I order you around?

360
00:27:27,350 --> 00:27:29,819
You did order me around.

361
00:27:29,819 --> 00:27:32,989
Do I have to stop because you tell me so?
Am I your subordinate?

362
00:27:32,989 --> 00:27:33,989
Look here.

363
00:27:36,029 --> 00:27:37,529
What did I do wrong?

364
00:27:38,799 --> 00:27:42,069
I spent time and effort to help you.
What's your problem?

365
00:27:42,569 --> 00:27:43,970
Hey, just leave it.

366
00:27:44,329 --> 00:27:47,970
Help me?
What, are you expecting gratitude?

367
00:27:47,970 --> 00:27:50,009
Should I pay you for your services?

368
00:27:51,170 --> 00:27:53,039
What was that?

369
00:27:53,779 --> 00:27:55,509
Why don't you say that again?

370
00:27:57,509 --> 00:27:59,220
Spout that nonsense again.

371
00:28:01,420 --> 00:28:04,749
Let him go first.

372
00:28:15,059 --> 00:28:16,370
Darn it.

373
00:28:19,269 --> 00:28:20,470
Bum Seok!

374
00:28:22,239 --> 00:28:23,309
That crazy idiot.

375
00:28:26,140 --> 00:28:27,509
I'll go after him.

376
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:40,920
Bum Seok.

377
00:28:45,529 --> 00:28:46,759
What's gotten into you?

378
00:28:50,900 --> 00:28:51,970
Are you all right?

379
00:28:56,539 --> 00:28:58,009
Yes, I'm all right.

380
00:29:00,839 --> 00:29:02,049
I'm heading off.

381
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:28,100
This call cannot be connected.
Please leave a message...

382
00:29:28,100 --> 00:29:29,539
That scumbag!

383
00:29:29,940 --> 00:29:32,979
(Karaoke)

384
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:43,150
You idiot.

385
00:29:43,890 --> 00:29:45,819
Isn't it Oh Bum Seok?

386
00:29:47,259 --> 00:29:48,660
You're not wearing glasses.

387
00:29:50,789 --> 00:29:52,400
Who is he? How do you know him?

388
00:29:52,460 --> 00:29:53,660
Oh Bum Seok!

389
00:30:07,839 --> 00:30:08,979
Come with us.

390
00:30:09,850 --> 00:30:12,620
- What are they? Scum?
- Yes.

391
00:30:13,819 --> 00:30:15,220
He's a rich kid.

392
00:30:18,620 --> 00:30:21,390
I told you to come with us, you scumbag.

393
00:30:23,190 --> 00:30:25,700
This non-entity is getting on my nerves.

394
00:30:26,130 --> 00:30:27,200
Shall I teach you a lesson?

395
00:30:28,769 --> 00:30:30,729
What luck. I needed some money anyway.

396
00:30:30,729 --> 00:30:32,440
You have lots of money, don't you?

397
00:30:34,370 --> 00:30:35,910
No need to be scared.

398
00:30:35,910 --> 00:30:37,539
We'll just have a little chat.

399
00:30:39,539 --> 00:30:41,279
Hold your face up.

400
00:30:41,839 --> 00:30:43,279
Hold it up properly, you scumbag.

401
00:30:45,650 --> 00:30:47,779
You hold your face up too.

402
00:30:48,049 --> 00:30:50,249
Why were you at the karaoke
instead of studying?

403
00:30:51,950 --> 00:30:54,259
- Darn it.
- Get your cell phone out.

404
00:30:56,130 --> 00:30:57,729
It's 667502...

405
00:30:58,729 --> 00:31:00,329
and 1184117.

406
00:31:00,960 --> 00:31:02,329
Lee Jeong Chan.

407
00:31:04,569 --> 00:31:05,600
How much is it?

408
00:31:06,539 --> 00:31:10,269
- These guys don't have much money.
- I'll kill you.

409
00:31:14,710 --> 00:31:16,950
What's with the dirty look, you scumbag?

410
00:31:16,950 --> 00:31:20,380
You have something more to say to me?

411
00:31:20,380 --> 00:31:22,150
You scumbag.

412
00:31:22,819 --> 00:31:25,390
- You scumbag.
- He's lost it.

413
00:31:28,989 --> 00:31:31,729
Bum Seok, do it properly.
You're being too soft.

414
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:33,759
- I'll kill you, you scumbag.
- That's it!

415
00:31:33,759 --> 00:31:36,170
- You scumbag.
- He's got the hang of it now.

416
00:31:36,329 --> 00:31:37,700
Scumbag.

417
00:31:44,069 --> 00:31:46,180
Say it again, you scumbag.

418
00:31:58,920 --> 00:32:00,989
Are you done? Let's go for a drink.

419
00:32:03,989 --> 00:32:04,989
Sure.

420
00:32:19,140 --> 00:32:22,210
- One?
- The other girl did look like Soo Jin.

421
00:32:22,210 --> 00:32:24,009
If we want to impress girls like that,
we need at least a bottle of vodka.

422
00:32:24,009 --> 00:32:25,850
How much money do you guys have?

423
00:32:25,850 --> 00:32:27,249
How much did we get out of those guys?

424
00:32:27,249 --> 00:32:29,350
That only covers what we have here now.

425
00:32:29,350 --> 00:32:31,950
Forget it. It's hard to get girls
when there are six of us anyway.

426
00:32:33,989 --> 00:32:36,229
It's my treat, so order what you want.

427
00:32:36,559 --> 00:32:39,460
- What's this?
- What's this?

428
00:32:39,529 --> 00:32:41,059
- Gosh.
- Bum Seok!

429
00:32:42,130 --> 00:32:44,470
- Oh Bum Seok!
- Oh Bum Seok!

430
00:32:44,470 --> 00:32:47,039
- Oh Bum Seok!
- Oh Bum Seok!

431
00:32:47,039 --> 00:32:49,210
- Get in, guys.
- Hold the money up.

432
00:32:49,210 --> 00:32:50,739
- Hold the money up.
- Come on, hold it up.

433
00:32:50,739 --> 00:32:52,309
- One, two, three...
- Down in one!

434
00:32:52,309 --> 00:32:54,979
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

435
00:32:58,610 --> 00:33:00,150
Go find some pretty girls now.

436
00:33:00,549 --> 00:33:02,350
It's 500 dollars.

437
00:33:02,350 --> 00:33:04,190
- How do you like the drink? You like it?
- Yes, it's good.

438
00:33:04,819 --> 00:33:06,489
Gosh.

439
00:33:08,089 --> 00:33:10,360
Bum Seok, what's your Instagram ID?

440
00:33:11,029 --> 00:33:12,229
I want to tag you.

441
00:33:16,499 --> 00:33:17,729
(Oh Bum Seok)

442
00:33:17,900 --> 00:33:19,700
- If you follow me, I'll follow you.
- Okay.

443
00:33:21,499 --> 00:33:22,610
It's done.

444
00:33:24,910 --> 00:33:27,779
- They're over there.
- Where?

445
00:33:29,009 --> 00:33:30,610
Let's go together.

446
00:33:30,610 --> 00:33:31,979
No, go with him.

447
00:33:31,979 --> 00:33:34,450
- I'm not good at things like this.
- I'll bring them.

448
00:33:35,049 --> 00:33:36,489
You had better succeed.

449
00:33:37,089 --> 00:33:39,759
This is great.

450
00:33:39,759 --> 00:33:40,989
- Let's toast.
- Wait!

451
00:33:40,989 --> 00:33:42,759
Let's drink!

452
00:33:45,600 --> 00:33:47,160
Hey, slow down.

453
00:33:49,729 --> 00:33:51,430
You'll get really drunk
if you drink like that.

454
00:33:51,430 --> 00:33:52,440
It's strong.

455
00:33:56,509 --> 00:33:57,769
I'll have to get a girl
for Bum Seok tonight.

456
00:33:57,769 --> 00:33:59,839
Where's the girl Bum Seok likes?

457
00:34:03,049 --> 00:34:04,350
No, they're not that pretty.

458
00:34:04,350 --> 00:34:05,749
You have such high standards.

459
00:34:05,749 --> 00:34:07,779
- You're the weird one.
- Keep looking.

460
00:34:08,350 --> 00:34:09,519
How about her?

461
00:34:11,989 --> 00:34:13,819
(An Soo Ho)

462
00:34:14,220 --> 00:34:16,129
(Following)

463
00:34:17,689 --> 00:34:21,129
(Unfollow)

464
00:34:21,299 --> 00:34:22,770
- Where?
- Look!

465
00:34:24,029 --> 00:34:25,230
They're coming.

466
00:34:25,399 --> 00:34:27,540
You failed.

467
00:34:27,540 --> 00:34:30,310
- You loser.
- Really.

468
00:34:30,310 --> 00:34:33,239
It's not that.
Up close, she wasn't at all my type.

469
00:34:33,339 --> 00:34:34,640
Is that why you did that?

470
00:34:34,640 --> 00:34:36,649
I'm telling you. She's really ugly.

471
00:34:36,649 --> 00:34:39,279
- Whatever.
- You loser, you didn't even say a word.

472
00:34:39,279 --> 00:34:42,020
You didn't say a word.
Just stay out of it or go home.

473
00:34:42,220 --> 00:34:44,819
- Pour another glass.
- I poured a lot in that glass.

474
00:34:45,919 --> 00:34:48,120
- I'm a bit drunk.
- No.

475
00:34:48,120 --> 00:34:49,759
- You can't get drunk yet.
- I am though.

476
00:34:51,759 --> 00:34:53,259
Hey! Where's he going?

477
00:34:53,259 --> 00:34:54,799
- Where are you going?
- Where are you going?

478
00:35:16,220 --> 00:35:17,319
Aren't you girls playing?

479
00:35:18,890 --> 00:35:19,890
What's this?

480
00:35:22,189 --> 00:35:23,629
Play with us.

481
00:35:30,930 --> 00:35:32,339
Really?

482
00:35:32,899 --> 00:35:34,270
She's better than that girl.

